            <title>1.9</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 00:00:19 +0700</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[<html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0 4px}h2{font-size:20px;margin:6px 0 4px}h3{font-size:13px;margin:16px 0 4px}p{margin:4px 0}.date{opacity:.6}ul{margin:4px 0;padding-left:20px}li{margin:4px 0}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}</style></head><body><h2>1.9</h2><p class="date">Release date: 2 Oct 2026</p><h3>New in 1.9</h3><ul><li>The menu bar bolt turns yellow when a chat's context gets expensive – click it to see which chat</li><li>14-day free trial of everything. After it, the last 5 hours and 24 hours stay free for good; week and month history, editing, copying /commands and opening chats come with a one-time license</li><li>Check for Updates installs quietly, without a dialog</li><li>Minor UX/UI improvements</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
